  "records": [
    {
      "id": "air_step_01",
      "family_id": "budapest_airbnp_position_collective_2015",
      "text": "来源在短住条件下采用开放挂杆以便取用衣物。本重建保留开放挂衣供给，并根据已测的东侧餐位通路损失移动衣架；位置由研究者选择，需在执行后检查是否恢复通路及是否损害另一侧接近。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/air_step_01/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "5aaf390c66957b9ad85a157b50323929d93c1b38a05a73e2cb387d44c8bf73e0",
      "text_sha256": "19b40b21098d7098cbf904423a566eca7368a22a0ad8d34a1f945077a18a2733"
    },
    {
      "id": "storage_step_01",
      "family_id": "paris_30m2_richard_guilbault_2015",
      "text": "建筑师在小面积住宅中把储物与技术需求集中到长墙。本迁移只表达沿房间一侧集中保留柜体，为连续起居活动留出位置；先移动第一件柜体，实际通路和柜前接近仍须逐步检查。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/storage_step_01/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "1cbf6bb019c0816c61a1fa870101b2039c7313dde4b66ca4b875359df36d7889",
      "text_sha256": "ae61a54f4397b645b41e362933db0de15eeba6c7926c0d74cf5876085faf0f80"
    },
    {
      "id": "storage_step_02",
      "family_id": "paris_30m2_richard_guilbault_2015",
      "text": "将第二件柜体先移到过渡位置，随后再沿空出的路径移向同一侧。这是研究者构造的操作次序，不能保证搬运或人体操作可行。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/storage_step_02/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "c37cfbca0bc66ee640d20fe829786946c647757caeeb54ddd7f12c2d474fbfbc",
      "text_sha256": "babe4f5aa0baaad1bb30bf3a8ae7146141406f4d533c3af9efcf47f8146d0dfc"
    },
    {
      "id": "storage_step_03",
      "family_id": "paris_30m2_richard_guilbault_2015",
      "text": "沿已声明的路径调整第二件柜体；保持其身份、尺寸和其他家具，下一步再完成侧边集中。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/storage_step_03/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "020bf769970476ae9217b83d46764d3f0057ba7689fcefaf45ecd72c6fbe8ff6",
      "text_sha256": "fd11658380f93bd964a3ef07488d4f456a316417ffa2fb686cdc8e20bde7cb89"
    },
    {
      "id": "storage_step_04",
      "family_id": "paris_30m2_richard_guilbault_2015",
      "text": "将第二件柜体移入侧边排列位置，保留其原实例；完成后仍要核查柜前空间和其他活动路径。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/storage_step_04/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "0d1128df7653a79d306751e6183953abf511a88417d3f2249b90eb7719106755",
      "text_sha256": "2e418c60bd1a3512c9481477872da5f0b699c63f7a247550c2745baa16f90a33"
    },
    {
      "id": "storage_step_05",
      "family_id": "paris_30m2_richard_guilbault_2015",
      "text": "把第三件柜体放到同一侧，完成本次集中方案。不能预先断言整屋改善，须核实际空地、全部接近点、容量及尚未知的功能。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/storage_step_05/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "802dea94faddd171ef9a752f197ab73985c5a0a92d1fdb999727654e021a7cee",
      "text_sha256": "1929b1cd17dd34ac4a8bb31a43f2c74d7f533aadd564f3c58b874f96cb04ada4"
    },
    {
      "id": "waterloo_step_01",
      "family_id": "singapore_waterloo_street_dess_chew",
      "text": "报道中Dess Chew为需要灵活配置的住户选择两张可分可合的带轮桌。本迁移准备把分桌工作改为合桌待客；先移动第二张桌对应的凳子。这一步次序和坐标是研究者实现，仍须检查实际通路。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/waterloo_step_01/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "ed30027652c3e088f15eab7bce4fbde11e79c51f098b9c20d396e3119c3c8a01",
      "text_sha256": "b72397ff8020e1e434f3e69d0b70be2d44a12025cfc71d28a370530a16caceb1"
    },
    {
      "id": "waterloo_step_02",
      "family_id": "singapore_waterloo_street_dess_chew",
      "text": "把第二张桌移到第一张桌旁，保留桌子实例和尺寸；完成后核实台面关系、四个声明餐位以及其他活动接近。这是研究者操作计划，不是设计师历史命令。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/waterloo_step_02/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "9bb03618895912ca49221a69ce75f722ebfe87007c13e13b478304980a1ffb52",
      "text_sha256": "9b4c3ba491f281e2a62ab30cf7766b4e341e5e9377970188f1115a3deffb0f44"
    },
    {
      "id": "waterloo_step_03",
      "family_id": "singapore_waterloo_street_dess_chew",
      "text": "待客阶段结束，把第二张桌移回分桌位置；保留两桌与所有其他对象，接下来再恢复对应工作凳。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/waterloo_step_03/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "2879ff799fc732c179ed8ed60f3e829259d640aad7476ae2c2ce3f0c60b71238",
      "text_sha256": "0843605c21d8ac13e3147f0dc66745a2ca8ed52733c1e9ba91891b994ff1401b"
    },
    {
      "id": "waterloo_step_04",
      "family_id": "singapore_waterloo_street_dess_chew",
      "text": "把第二张桌的工作凳恢复到声明工作位置；用实际终态核查两个独立工位和整屋接近，不能预先宣称精确回位或物理搬运成功。",
      "episode": "/data/wyh/scene_cvpr_20261020/design_decisions_920/runtime/P920-LOSS-v1_20261105T092125Z/prepare_absolute/episodes/waterloo_step_04/reason/episode.json",
      "episode_sha256": "20231295d617a77bc86afdeb1c29a53baba78c1e998f0d09bacb8cd954e088be",
